        "title": "Drug Development: Discovery to Approval",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Drug development is a 10-15 year, $2-3 billion process from identifying a target to a marketed drug. Failure rates are staggering: ~90% of drugs that enter clinical trials never reach approval. Understanding the pipeline architecture clarifies why drugs cost what they do and why failures are economically catastrophic."
    },
